  "title": {
    "zh_CN": "第一课 · 音阶与节奏",
    "en_US": "Lesson 1 · Scales and rhythm"
  },
  "goal": {
    "zh_CN": "听出音阶方向，唱准相邻音，并保持每音一拍。",
    "en_US": "Hear scale direction, match adjacent notes, and keep one beat per note."
  },
  "steps": {
    "zh_CN": "1. 先听完整音阶，留意高音 do。\n2. 用 do re mi 跟唱，上行与下行分别循环。\n3. 关闭旋律提示，按准备拍自己唱。\n4. 用麦克风练唱，查看偏高、偏低与八度提示。",
    "en_US": "1. Listen to the scale, including the upper do.\n2. Sing solfege; loop the ascending and descending phrases separately.\n3. Sing after the count-in without the melody.\n4. Record and review pitch direction and octave feedback."
  },
  "selfCheck": {
    "zh_CN": "每个音都唱到了吗？高音 do 是否高了一个八度？节拍是否均匀？",
    "en_US": "Did you sing every note? Is the upper do one octave higher? Is the pulse steady?"
  },
